'''Chika Amatori & Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from a login stamp during the [[World Trigger Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 679
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Chika Amatori & Cat
|name2 = Chika Amatori & Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Chika Amatori & Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit is okay at first, but quickly falls off once you unlock [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]]. As the game goes on, [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies get more and more aggressive due to extreme magnifications and quantity. It also doesn't help that she has pitifully low health and DPS, meaning they could easily push through and destroy a unit that isn't easy to replace once killed.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Sniper}}

